OWASP LLM Top 10 (2026) Self-Assessment
=======================================

This project is an interactive self-assessment aid for the OWASP Top 10 for
LLM Applications 2026. It is a self-assessment aid, not an audit or
certification.

Attribution
-----------
The risk categories, English titles, and identifiers (LLM01:2026 .. LLM10:2026)
are the work of the OWASP GenAI Security Project:

  OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2026
  OWASP GenAI Security Project
  https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-genai-llm-top-10-2026/
  Published: 2026-08-04

Official vs. unofficial
-----------------------
- The English risk titles and IDs are OFFICIAL and belong to the OWASP GenAI
  Security Project.
- The Turkish text in this repository is an UNOFFICIAL community translation.
- The authoritative text is the English OWASP source.
- The summaries, the yes/no self-assessment controls, and the 2025 -> 2026
  change notes are editorial content grounded in the OWASP source; the change
  notes reflect the official reordering/renaming and are not invented mappings.
  No statistics, CVEs, incidents, or MITRE ATLAS identifiers are invented here.

